{"unit_id":"2710586329__dsh-qq#card-zh","repo":"2710586329/dsh-qq","commit":"224ad59603b176580241b45d3f1b3ec53a5d7eeb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-onebot 是一个 DSH 插件，通过 OneBot 11 正向 WebSocket 将 QQ 私聊和群聊接入宿主 Agent。插件为不同 QQ 对话维护会话，并把收到的消息交给 Agent 处理，再将回复送回 QQ；群聊可按 @、引用和配置决定是否回应。它还提供 QQ 设置面板、会话工作区，以及供 Agent 使用的消息互动工具。适合希望在 QQ 中和 DSH Agent 对话并管理群聊接入方式的用户。使用前需要本机运行 NapCat 或其他 OneBot 11 服务，并配置 WebSocket 地址；离线语音识别为可选能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:286-296","src/inbound.js:594-621","src/outbound.js:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"2710586329__dsh-qq#card-en","repo":"2710586329/dsh-qq","commit":"224ad59603b176580241b45d3f1b3ec53a5d7eeb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-onebot connects QQ private and group chats to a DSH Agent over OneBot 11. It routes incoming messages to the matching Agent session and returns replies to QQ. The plugin also has a QQ settings panel and interaction tools. Configure a local NapCat or other OneBot 11 WebSocket service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:286-296","src/inbound.js:594-621","src/outbound.js:1-10"]}
